d 'SLIDEVIEWER': module to navigate SMCL slides, presentations, and tutorials in the Stata Viewer
d
d  slideviewer turns a folder of .smcl files into an interactive
d presentation or tutorial inside the Stata Viewer, so a deck needs
d no hard-coded Next and Previous links in each slide. Move through
d the deck alphabetically with next, prev, first, and last; the
d navbar option injects a clickable [First] [Prev] [TOC] [Next]
d [Last] header and footer into any slide as it is shown.
d slideviewer toc builds a clickable table of contents of every
d .smcl file in the project directory. The project subdirectory is
d set once and remembered for the rest of the session. Fully UTF-8
d aware. 
d
d KW: SMCL; presentation; teaching; utilities
d
d Requires: Stata version 16.0
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260730
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Texas 2036
d Support: email eric.a.booth@@gmail.com
d
f slideviewer.ado
f slideviewer.sthlp
